        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.12+LUK.10.13+LUK.10.14+LUK.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 10:12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaatandikira aho kuhana tauni ahu yaakoreire eby'okutangaaza ebirikukira obwingi, ahabw'okuba bakanga kweteisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati: Iwe Koraziini, oryakareeba! Naiwe, Besesaida, oryakareeba, ahabw'okuba eby'okutangaaza ebyakoreirwe omuriimwe, kuri noogira ngu bikakorerwa Tuuro na Sidoni, bakaabaire beeteisize kare, bajwaire ebiguniya, beeshukyeire eiju rya kashenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nimbagambira nti: Aha kito ky'okucwa orubanja, ekifubiro ky'okucwa orubanja, ekifubiro kya Tuuro na Sidoni kiryaba ekirikubaasa kwemerwa okukira ekyanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.8.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naiwe Kaperenaumu, nooyeraata ngu oryakuzibwa ohikye omu iguru? Ngabusha, oryagarurwa ahansi ohikye okuzimu. Ahabw'okuba eby'okutangaaza ebyakoreirwe omuriiwe, kuri noogira ngu bikakorerwa Sodoma, ekaabaire ekiriho n'okuhitsya hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoona nimbagambira nti: Aha kiro ky'okucwa orubanja, ekifubiro kya Sodoma kiryaba ekirikubaasa kwemerwa okukira ekyanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
